    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "The  principle  of  this  game  is   significantly"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "different  from  these of most of other games. The"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "number of players is practically  unlimited.  Your"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "task is to prepare your own snake for competitions"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "(i.e.  to  create  and  to train it) but in battle"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "itself you can be  only  a  spectator.  The  snake"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "begins  to  live  its  own  life:  takes  part  in"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "competitions, behaves according  to  the  strategy"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "you have taught it, wins or loses and - who knows?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "-  may  yield you a profit and glory. Besides, you"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "always have the opportunity  to  improve  fighting"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "qualities  of  your snake (of course, if it is not"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "characters": 35,
      "text": "engaged yet in a large tournament)."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%EndPage"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "In one  combat  up  to  4  snakes  can  take  part"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "simultaneously. They attack each other. If snake's"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "head  touches  enemy's  tail  it will bite it off,"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "thus shortening the enemy's body by one  cell  and"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "adding  it  to  its own length. The winner has the"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "maximum length at the end of the  battle.  Snake's"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "length can be regarded as the amount of won points"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "characters": 11,
      "text": "or dollars."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "characters": 37,
      "text": "To create a fighting snake - that is:"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "characters": 37,
      "text": "     * to choose name for your snake,"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "characters": 28,
      "text": "     * to choose its colour,"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "characters": 38,
      "text": "     * to make passport for the snake,"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "characters": 49,
      "text": "     * to programme its strategy on battle field,"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "characters": 25,
      "text": "     * to set a password."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "Your  snake is your property, therefore nobody can"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "change it or pry secrets of  its  program  without"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "characters": 26,
      "text": "knowing your own password."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%EndPage"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
