    {
      "index": 67,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "when  it  is  empty  and  type  a  new  name  when"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "twinkling cursor appears. If you enter a name that"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "already exists  then  the  corresponding  cassette"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "characters": 29,
      "text": "from the bank will be loaded."
