      "text": "of complexity of programming instrument."
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "Rating is proportional to the  average  length  of"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "the snake through all its battles and primarily is"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "equal  to 1000. In the passport you can print your"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
