      "index": 199,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "sequence of snakes moves is determined by  chance."
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "Then each snake makes a move in its turn. The move"
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "means  either transportation on one empty cell, or"
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "biting off the opponent's tail with transportation"
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "to its place. If both  is  impossible,  the  snake"
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "characters": 19,
      "text": "remains motionless."
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "Snake's  behaviour is programmed by means of cards"
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "consisting of 7*7 positions, which can  be  filled"
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "with   conventional   elements  described  on  the"
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "control panel. The player can  use  from  1  to  9"
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "characters": 6,
      "text": "cards."
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%EndPage"
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "At  every moment of time a snake takes a view of a"
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "field fragment of 7*7 cells around  its  head  and"
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "compares  it  with the first card of its behaviour"
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "(rotating it if necessary). The card is considered"
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "coincided   with   field   fragment    if    while"
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "superimposing  it  under  all  the elements of the"
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "card the same elements of the field are found.  If"
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "it  occurs,  the  direction of the snake's head on"
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "the card will show the direction of its motion  on"
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "characters": 16,
      "text": "the  next  step."
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "If  not,  the  fragment  will be compared with the"
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "second card and so on, until the  proper  card  is"
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "found.  If  there  is  no  corresponding card, the"
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "direction of  snake's  movement  will  be  random."
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "While  comparing  the  card  can be rotated in all"
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "directions, for example, it can be overturned with"
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "picture down. That is why you needn't  make  cards"
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%EndPage"
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "with  symmetrical disposition of elements, because"
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "characters": 43,
      "text": "these cards will work exactly the same way."
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "characters": 52,
      "text": "%f(0:15:155:38)\"15-pict.blo\" x:20 y:4 sn1\"MAIN MENU\""
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "characters": 7,
      "text": "%l3 X:0"
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "by means of this screen button you can quit to the"
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "characters": 10,
      "text": "main menu."
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%EndPage"
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "characters": 14,
      "text": "Regime NOVICE."
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "In  the  right  bottom  part of screen you see the"
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "indicator of work with cards which can be  in  one"
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "characters": 28,
      "text": "of the following conditions:"
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "characters": 34,
      "text": "%f(234:0:250:12)\"15-pict.blo\" x:40"
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "characters": 9,
      "text": "EDIT CARD"
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%X:0 l:1"
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "characters": 34,
      "text": "%f(270:0:286:12)\"15-pict.blo\" x:40"
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "characters": 11,
      "text": "INSERT CARD"
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%X:0 l:1"
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "characters": 34,
      "text": "%f(252:0:268:12)\"15-pict.blo\" x:40"
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "characters": 11,
      "text": "DELETE CARD"
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%X:0 l:2"
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "Switching  of regimes is made by pressing ENTER or"
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "clicking mouse button while the  arrow  cursor  is"
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "characters": 24,
      "text": "placed on the indicator."
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%EndPage"
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "characters": 34,
      "text": "%f(234:0:250:12)\"15-pict.blo\" x:40"
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "characters": 9,
      "text": "EDIT CARD"
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%X:0 l:1"
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "By  means  of arrow cursor activate the element on"
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "the control panel you want to put in a card.  Then"
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "point  the  position in the card where you want to"
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "place it and press ENTER or click mouse button. To"
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "characters": 37,
      "text": "delete the element press ENTER again."
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "characters": 34,
      "text": "%f(270:0:286:12)\"15-pict.blo\" x:40"
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "characters": 11,
      "text": "INSERT CARD"
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%X:0 l:1"
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "put the arrow cursor on the card before which  you"
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "want  to insert a new one and press ENTER or click"
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "characters": 13,
      "text": "mouse button."
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "characters": 34,
      "text": "%f(252:0:268:12)\"15-pict.blo\" x:40"
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "characters": 11,
      "text": "DELETE CARD"
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%X:0 l:1"
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "place the cursor on the card you  want  to  delete"
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "characters": 38,
      "text": "and press ENTER or click mouse button."
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "Screen  buttons  FOR ADVANCED are not used in this"
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "characters": 7,
      "text": "regime."
    },
    {
      "index": 287,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%EndPage"
    },
    {
      "index": 288,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 289,
      "characters": 16,
      "text": "Regime ADVANCED."
    },
    {
      "index": 290,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 291,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "This  part  is  for   players   who   regard   the"
    },
    {
      "index": 292,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "instruments  suggested  in  the  regime NOVICE too"
    },
    {
      "index": 293,
      "characters": 7,
      "text": "simple."
    },
    {
      "index": 294,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 295,
      "characters": 45,
      "text": "On the  control  panel two buttons are added:"
    },
    {
      "index": 296,
      "characters": 19,
      "text": "OR-COLOR and EXCEPT"
    },
    {
      "index": 297,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 298,
      "characters": 34,
      "text": "%f(162:0:178:12)\"15-pict.blo\" x:40"
    },
    {
      "index": 299,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "OR-COLOR"
    },
    {
      "index": 300,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%X:0 l:1"
    },
    {
      "index": 301,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "when this button with blue indicator is activated,"
    },
    {
      "index": 302,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "you can change the colour of any element on  cards"
    },
    {
      "index": 303,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "to  the colour of indicator. Point the element you"
    },
    {
      "index": 304,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "want to repaint and press  ENTER  or  click  mouse"
    },
    {
      "index": 305,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "button. To cancel OR-COLOR press the button again."
    },
    {
      "index": 306,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 307,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%EndPage"
    },
    {
      "index": 308,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 309,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "The  rules  of  comparing cards are different from"
    },
    {
      "index": 310,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "these of regime NOVICE. For executing a card  with"
    },
    {
      "index": 311,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "one  or several blue elements it is enough that at"
    },
    {
      "index": 312,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "least one of such elements would coincide (at  the"
    },
    {
      "index": 313,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "same   time   all   the   ordinary  elements  must"
    },
    {
      "index": 314,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "coincide). If it occurs in  several  positions  of"
    },
    {
      "index": 315,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "the  card  the  program  will choose one where the"
    },
    {
      "index": 316,
      "characters": 29,
      "text": "coincidence is more complete."
    },
    {
      "index": 317,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 318,
      "characters": 34,
      "text": "%f(144:0:160:12)\"15-pict.blo\" x:40"
    },
    {
      "index": 319,
      "characters": 6,
      "text": "EXCEPT"
    },
    {
      "index": 320,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%X:0 l:1"
    },
    {
      "index": 321,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "when this button is activated, the element pointed"
    },
    {
      "index": 322,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "by cursor will be crossed out. This  element  will"
    },
    {
      "index": 323,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "coincide  if in its place on the field any element"
    },
    {
      "index": 324,
      "characters": 25,
      "text": "except this one is found."
    },
    {
      "index": 325,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 326,
      "characters": 45,
      "text": "The button EXPERT is not used in this regime."
    },
    {
      "index": 327,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%EndPage"
    },
    {
      "index": 328,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 329,
      "characters": 14,
      "text": "Regime EXPERT."
    },
    {
      "index": 330,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 331,
      "characters": 21,
      "text": "The regime for elite."
    },
    {
      "index": 332,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 333,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "On the control panel  the  button  is  added  with"
    },
    {
      "index": 334,
      "characters": 17,
      "text": "colour indicator:"
    },
    {
      "index": 335,
      "characters": 4,
      "text": "%y:5"
    },
    {
      "index": 336,
      "characters": 34,
      "text": "%f(180:0:196:12)\"15-pict.blo\" x:40"
    },
    {
      "index": 337,
      "characters": 9,
      "text": "AND-COLOR"
    },
    {
      "index": 338,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%X:0 l:2"
    },
    {
      "index": 339,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "and  one more OR-COLOUR appears (now they are blue"
    },
    {
      "index": 340,
      "characters": 11,
      "text": "and green)."
    },
    {
      "index": 341,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 342,
      "characters": 29,
      "text": "The rules of comparing cards:"
    },
    {
      "index": 343,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 344,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "All  the  elements  of  the  same   colour   (from"
    },
    {
      "index": 345,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "AND-COLOUR set) must coincide simultaneously. Then"
    },
    {
      "index": 346,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "it is considered that this colour group coincides."
    },
    {
      "index": 347,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "There  is  also  a possibility added to change the"
    },
    {
      "index": 348,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%EndPage"
    },
    {
      "index": 349,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 350,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "colour of the frame encircling each card entirely."
    },
    {
      "index": 351,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "For this put the cursor on the  proper  indicator,"
    },
    {
      "index": 352,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "pick up the colour, then put the cursor on the own"
    },
    {
      "index": 353,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "head of your snake in chosen card and press ENTER."
    },
    {
      "index": 354,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "Along  with  the frame the colour of OWN HEAD will"
    },
    {
      "index": 355,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "be changed. If the frame colour is  the  one  from"
    },
    {
      "index": 356,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "AND-COLOUR  then the card is compared the same way"
    },
    {
      "index": 357,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "as in ADVANCED regime. If it is from  OR-COLOUR  -"
    },
    {
      "index": 358,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "then  the  card will coincide when at least one of"
    },
    {
      "index": 359,
      "characters": 28,
      "text": "the colour groups coincides."
    },
    {
      "index": 360,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 361,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "In this regime you can change the position of  OWN"
    },
    {
      "index": 362,
      "characters": 14,
      "text": "HEAD in cards."
    },
    {
      "index": 363,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 364,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%EndPage"
    },
    {
      "index": 365,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 366,
      "characters": 31,
      "text": "OPTIONS OF THE MAIN MENU. HELP."
    },
    {
      "index": 367,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 368,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "Information about the authors of the game and game"
    },
    {
      "index": 369,
      "characters": 12,
      "text": "description."
    },
    {
      "index": 370,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 371,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 372,
      "characters": 39,
      "text": "OPTIONS OF THE MAIN MENU. NEW PASSWORD."
    },
    {
      "index": 373,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 374,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "Here  you  can  change the password of your snake."
    },
    {
      "index": 375,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "Put the cursor on the screen button,  press  ENTER"
    },
    {
      "index": 376,
      "characters": 50,
      "text": "or  click  mouse  button and type in new password."
    },
    {
      "index": 377,
      "characters": 24,
      "text": "The password is changed."
    },
    {
      "index": 378,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 379,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 380,
      "characters": 31,
      "text": "OPTIONS OF THE MAIN MENU. EXIT."
    },
    {
      "index": 381,
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 382,
      "characters": 35,
      "text": "Interrupt the game and quit to DOS."
    },
    {
      "index": 383,
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "%EndPage"
    },
    {
      "index": 384,
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "\u001a"
    }
  ]
}
